WEBVTT

00:04:29.098 --> 00:04:32.059
but also to be more resilient
as an economy.

00:04:33.352 --> 00:04:38.774
Repair is also a point of entry
for a lot of our engineers and innovators.

00:04:38.816 --> 00:04:42.361
I heard Steve Wozniak
speak very recently --

00:04:42.361 --> 00:04:44.864
Apple Steve Wozniak --

00:04:46.115 --> 00:04:50.286
He spoke very recently
about his growth and development

00:04:50.286 --> 00:04:53.956
at a time when he was repairing
things as a kid.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:57.126
And it was central
to his development as an engineer.

00:04:57.752 --> 00:05:00.296
He grew up pretty much
the same time I did,